{#
  ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
  "WE ARE AFRICA" — WeAreAfrica.dc.html, on GlobeBand's markers (Phase 4, §8.1 item 5)
  ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

  Args: `countries` (GlobeBand::countries()), `note` (GlobeBand::note()).
  Script: public/assets/js/we-are-africa.js. Sheet: components/home.css (`.waa`).
  Guide: docs/GLOBE-BAND.md.

  ── WHAT THE DC DREW, AND WHAT THIS DRAWS ──────────────────────────────────

  The DC pops photo pins of invented people over invented cities on a timer — "Ngozi in
  Enugu just joined" — the same fake telemetry the previous band shipped over sixteen
  cities and had to be rebuilt to remove (CLAUDE.md, "the homepage globe band"). None of
  it is recorded here. The markers are GlobeBand's: a nation with a nominee standing in a
  live award, at the CENTROID of that country's own polygon in the shipped geometry, so
  nothing is typed and no marker can drift from its outline. The ring means an award has
  been DECIDED there — rare by nature, which is why it is the highlight. The bottom line is
  GlobeBand::note(), which states what the markers are (and says out loud if a live nation
  cannot be drawn), in place of the invented "just joined" ticker.

  Every marker is a real button: Enter or a click opens the nation's card (nominees
  standing, votes cast — the only two rows the platform can fill). Focusing one on the far
  side turns the globe to it, because a focused control nobody can see fails WCAG 2.4.7;
  the arrow keys turn the globe, because a drag alone fails 2.5.7. The script places them
  and lifts `hidden`; without it the heading and the note still say what the band is.
#}
<section class="waa" aria-labelledby="waa-h" data-waa data-topo="{{ asset('/assets/geo/countries-110m.json') }}"
         data-l-nominees="{{ 'Nominees standing'|trans }}" data-l-votes="{{ 'Votes cast'|trans }}"
         data-l-decided="{{ 'An award has been decided here'|trans }}">
  <canvas class="waa__globe" tabindex="0" role="img" data-waa-canvas
          aria-label="{{ 'Globe centred on Africa. Drag or use the arrow keys to turn it.'|trans }}"></canvas>
  <div class="waa__pins" data-waa-pins>
    {% for c in countries %}
      <button type="button" class="waa__m{{ c.decided ? ' waa__m--won' }}" hidden
              data-geo="{{ c.geo }}" data-name="{{ c.name }}" data-nominees="{{ c.nominees|number_format }}"
              data-votes="{{ c.votes|number_format }}" data-decided="{{ c.decided ? '1' : '0' }}"
              aria-controls="waa-card" aria-expanded="false"
              aria-label="{{ (c.decided
                  ? (c.nominees == 1 ? '%name%: an award decided, 1 nominee standing' : '%name%: an award decided, %n% nominees standing')
                  : (c.nominees == 1 ? '%name%: 1 nominee standing' : '%name%: %n% nominees standing'))|trans({'%name%': c.name, '%n%': c.nominees|number_format}) }}">
        <span class="waa__dot" aria-hidden="true">{% if c.decided %}<svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><path d="M4 10.5 8.5 15 16 5.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>{% endif %}</span>
        {# A label for a decided nation, else for the busiest one (GlobeBand orders by
           votes), so a new edition is not a globe of unlabelled dots. #}
        {% if c.decided or (loop.first and not (countries|filter(x => x.decided)|length)) %}<span class="waa__lbl" aria-hidden="true">{{ c.name }}</span>{% endif %}
      </button>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
  <h2 class="waa__h" id="waa-h">{{ 'We are Africa'|trans }}</h2>
  <div class="waa__card" id="waa-card" role="region" aria-label="{{ 'Country detail'|trans }}" hidden data-waa-card tabindex="-1">
    <div class="waa__card-hd">
      <p class="waa__card-n" data-waa-name></p>
      <button type="button" class="waa__x" data-waa-close aria-label="{{ 'Close'|trans }}"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18 6 6 18M6 6l12 12"></path></svg></button>
    </div>
    <p class="waa__card-won" data-waa-won hidden></p>
    <dl class="waa__rows">
      <div><dt data-waa-l-nominees></dt><dd data-waa-nominees></dd></div>
      <div><dt data-waa-l-votes></dt><dd data-waa-votes></dd></div>
    </dl>
  </div>
  <p class="waa__note">{{ note }}</p>
</section>
